  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Tom and Lily are at the table. Mom has two big papers. \"Today we make hats,\" says Mom. \"I tell you one thing at a time.\" \"Take your paper.\" Tom takes his paper. Lily takes her paper. \"Put it on the table.\" The children put the papers on the table.",
      "\"Fold it in two.\" Lily folds her paper. \"Fold it again.\" Tom folds his paper again. \"Fold one end up.\" \"Is this good?\" asks Tom. Mom looks at his hands. \"Yes, it is,\" says Mom. \"Now open it.\" Tom opens his paper. It is a hat!",
      "\"Put it on your head.\" Tom puts the hat on his head. Lily puts her hat on her head. \"Draw a big smile,\" says Mom. The children draw a smile on the hats. Pip looks at them. Mom makes a small hat for Pip. \"Now sing a song!\" Tom, Lily, and Mom sing. \"Woof!\" says Pip."
    ],
    "summary": "Mom tells Tom and Lily how to make a paper hat, one command at a time. At the end, the children and Pip wear hats and sing a song.",
